# v0.6.1

**Release v0.6.1**

**Chat transcripts**
Human turns now render with a human avatar instead of the duckling duck graphic — duckling turns keep the duck. The human avatar shows on reopened transcripts as well as new ones, and the avatar itself was refreshed.

**Release view**
A drafted release can now be sent back for revision: the Release view has a request-changes action on drafts instead of leaving them stuck until accepted.

**Removing tasks**
Tasks can now be retired. A new `ducklab task remove` command and matching `task_remove` MCP tool let you drop a task, and the plan-amendment flow knows how to use that retire path.

**Configuration and verification**
`project.toml` now takes a `[verify]` section with `link_deps` and `setup` keys, so the checkout preparation your verification depends on can be declared instead of assumed. When a gate still fails, the message names the missing path rather than failing opaquely.

**Plan amendments**
When a reviewer requests changes on a plan-extend proposal, that request now routes back into the amendment as its own fragment with its own note, running in solo mode — changes to the amendment are handled there directly instead of getting lost.

**Concurrent workspaces**
Worktree creation and removal are now serialized per repository, so contestants running in parallel no longer race each other when setting up or tearing down workspaces.

**Model sessions**
A turn now ends once the model's write attempts on a single file have been refused repeatedly, instead of grinding on; re-reading a braked file reopens a one-probe window so the model can try again with fresh context.

## What shipped

### M-001

- **T-069** End the turn after repeated fs_patch-brake refusals on one file (`fa3a3e2`)
- **T-070** Reset the fs_patch per-file brake when the model fs_reads the braked file, restoring a one-probe window (`fe20efe`)
- **T-071** Add [verify] link_deps and setup keys to project.toml so checkout preparation is declared, and make gate failures name the missing path (`9baf2b5`)
- **T-072** Route request_changes on a plan_extend proposal back into the amendment with its own fragment, note, and solo mode (`c89e7df`)
- **T-073** Expose TaskRemove as MCP task_remove and CLI `ducklab task remove`, and teach plan_extend the retire path (`3a86788`)
- **T-074** Serialize git worktree add/remove per repository so concurrent contestant workspaces cannot race .git/worktrees (`afbe1d2`)
- **T-075** Differentiate human turns in chat transcription (`938d3e7`)
- **T-076** Show the human avatar on human turns of reopened chat transcripts (`f46a5d4`)
- **T-077** Replace the current human-turn avatar (`2328a2f`)
- **T-078** Add a request-changes (revise) affordance for a drafted release in the Release view (`f3d0ffa`)

